flowchart TB
    Start["START-HERE<br/>read safety model and assumptions"]
    P00["00 Operator basics<br/>inventory, command contexts, secrets"]
    P01["01 Router/OpenWrt<br/>VLANs, DHCP, DNS, firewall, NTP, WireGuard fallback"]
    P02["02 Proxmox host<br/>install, bridge, VMs"]
    P03["03 Home Assistant<br/>HAOS, Mosquitto, ESPHome, VentSys base"]
    P04["04 Frigate<br/>CT 111, first-camera baseline"]
    P05["05 Docker-host<br/>Docker, Compose policy, Tailscale"]
    P05A["05A Local AI<br/>llm-host, llama.cpp, Wyoming voice"]
    P06["06 OMV NAS<br/>shares, users, storage health"]
    P07["07 Tier 1 apps<br/>AdGuard, Immich, Homepage, Dozzle"]
    P08["08 Tier 2 apps<br/>live/setup-pending + candidates"]
    P09["09 Tier 3/evaluate<br/>risk gates before deploy"]
    P10["10 Backups/monitoring/maintenance<br/>restore drills"]
    P11["11 Physical integrations<br/>VentSys, printers, cameras"]
    P12["12 Validation/troubleshooting<br/>end-to-end checks"]

    Start --> P00 --> P01 --> P02 --> P03 --> P04 --> P05 --> P05A --> P06 --> P07 --> P08 --> P09 --> P10 --> P11 --> P12

    Gate1["Gate: router validation passes"]
    Gate2["Gate: backups configured before risky apps"]
    Gate3["Gate: safety behavior tested before unattended operation"]

    P01 --> Gate1
    Gate1 --> P02
    P05A --> P10
    P07 --> Gate2
    Gate2 --> P08
    P11 --> Gate3
    Gate3 --> P12
